],"isbn_10":["0465058957"],"classifications":{},"physical_format":"Paperback","description":{"type":"/type/text","value":"The medical achievements of the post-war years rank as one of the supreme epochs of human endeavor. Advances in surgical technique, new ideas about the nature of disease and huge innovations in drug manufacture vanquished most common causes of early death, But, since the mid-1970s the rate of development has slowed, and the future of medicine is uncertain. How has this happened?\r\nJames Le Fanu's hugely acclaimed survey of the 'twelve definitive moments' of modern medicine and the intellectual vacuum which followed them has been fully revised and updated for this edition. The Rise and Fall of Modern Medicine is both riveting drama and a clarion call for change.(Source: Amazon)"},"lc_classifications":["R149.L4 2012"],"latest_revision":6,"revision":6,"created":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2008-09-14T12:00:26.536126"},"last_modified":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2021-12-26T23:37:48.019385"}},{"other_titles":["Rise & fall of modern medicine"],"publishers":["Little, Brown"],"identifiers":{"librarything":["305454"],"goodreads":["2519228"]},"ia_box_id":["IA152601"],"isbn_10":["0316648361"],"covers":[7005571],"physical_format":"Hardcover","ia_loaded_id":["risefallofmode00lefa"],"lc_classifications":["R149 .L38 1999","R131 .L44 1999"],"key":"/books/OL19839315M","authors":[{"key":"/authors/OL1521060A"}],"ocaid":"risefallofmode00lefa","publish_places":["London"],"pagination":"xxi, 490 p., [16] p. of plates :","classifications":{},"source_records":["ia:risefallofmode00lefa","bwb:9780316648363","marc:harvard_bibliographic_metadata/20220215_038.bib.mrc:105249517:3079"],"title":"The rise and fall of modern medicine","dewey_decimal_class":["610.9"],"notes":"Includes bibliographical references.","number_of_pages":490,"languages":[{"key":"/languages/eng"}],"subjects":["Medical innovations -- History -- 20th century","Medicine -- History -- 20th century.